MATERIALIZED VIEW = hasilnya disimpan, query hanya jalan saat di-refresh.
-----------------------------

Cocok untuk laporan berat yang datanya tidak perlu realtime:


-- Bikin materialized view
CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW mvw_laporan_bulanan AS
SELECT 
    DATE_TRUNC('month', tm.tanggal_masuk) AS bulan,
    s.nama_supplier,
    b.kategori,
    COUNT(*)                AS total_transaksi,
    SUM(tm.jumlah)          AS total_qty,
    SUM(tm.total_harga)     AS total_nilai
FROM transaksi_masuk tm
INNER JOIN barang b   ON tm.id_barang   = b.id_barang
INNER JOIN supplier s ON tm.id_supplier = s.id_supplier
GROUP BY 1, 2, 3
ORDER BY 1 DESC;

-- Refresh setiap malam jam 00:00 (via pg_cron atau scheduler)
REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW mvw_laporan_bulanan;

-- Pakai index di materialized view juga bisa!
CREATE INDEX idx_mvw_laporan_bulan ON mvw_laporan_bulanan(bulan);
```

---

## STORED PROCEDURE vs FUNCTION
```
FUNCTION        → mengembalikan nilai, bisa dipakai di SELECT
PROCEDURE       → menjalankan aksi, dipanggil dengan CALL